WEBVTT

00:08:56.957 --> 00:09:01.027
is not to settle 
by saying, "Online education."

00:09:01.027 --> 00:09:04.587
I think the pandemic 
has opened the horizon for everybody

00:09:04.587 --> 00:09:07.650
to relook at what we are really doing.

00:09:08.399 --> 00:09:13.179
Do formal degrees of a sense 
of four years bachelor's degree

00:09:13.179 --> 00:09:14.903
is the way to go for the future?

00:09:15.393 --> 00:09:18.780
What does lifelong learning mean

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.869
for people with a rapid change?

00:09:20.869 --> 00:09:24.889
How can we facilitate that 
to people within their workplace?

00:09:24.889 --> 00:09:27.197
How we can shift careers?

00:09:27.197 --> 00:09:32.049
What can we do in order for us 
to provide opportunities for each one